{"id":"d179a7fa180f99f9","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-separated-diagonal.md","title":"Theorem — j-分离性等价于对角与图像闭","display":"Theorem — j-分离性等价于对角与图像闭","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-separated-diagonal","aliases":["14-thm-separated-diagonal"],"display":"Theorem — j-分离性等价于对角与图像闭","source_ref":"V.3 Lemma 3, printed pp.227–228; DjVu119–120","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]","[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]]","[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-separated-diagonal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-separated-diagonal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — j-分离性等价于对角与图像闭"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"V.3 Lemma 3, printed pp.227–228; DjVu119–120"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" href=\"?note=1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" title=\"14-df-j-separated-objects\">14-df-j-separated-objects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1131fa8ff0b18434\" href=\"?note=1131fa8ff0b18434\" title=\"14-df-j-closed-monomorphism\">14-df-j-closed-monomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"38500c05a94778d2\" href=\"?note=38500c05a94778d2\" title=\"14-thm-closure-base-change\">14-thm-closure-base-change</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,j\">\\(\\mathcal E,j\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯与 LT 拓扑，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为对象。积和配对见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_X,\\delta_X\">\\(\\Delta_X,\\delta_X\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(f)\">\\(G(f)\\)</span> 在下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_U\">\\(\\chi_U\\)</span> 是子对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的特征箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:B\\to X\">\\(f:B\\to X\\)</span> 的图像作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\times X\">\\(B\\times X\\)</span> 的子对象解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJClosed}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsJClosed}\\)</span> 分别使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" href=\"?note=1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" title=\"14-df-j-separated-objects\">14-df-j-separated-objects</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1131fa8ff0b18434\" href=\"?note=1131fa8ff0b18434\" title=\"14-df-j-closed-monomorphism\">14-df-j-closed-monomorphism</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Y)\\)</span> 分别为范畴对象集合和已在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a> 绑定的子对象集合；本条所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 都是明确写出的环境对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_X\\coloneqq[\\langle1_X,1_X\\rangle]\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X\\times X),\\qquad\\delta_X\\coloneqq\\chi_{\\Delta_X}:X\\times X\\to\\Omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_X\\coloneqq[\\langle1_X,1_X\\rangle]\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X\\times X),\\qquad\\delta_X\\coloneqq\\chi_{\\Delta_X}:X\\times X\\to\\Omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G(f)\\coloneqq[\\langle1_B,f\\rangle]\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(B\\times X)\\qquad(f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G(f)\\coloneqq[\\langle1_B,f\\rangle]\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(B\\times X)\\qquad(f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,X\\times X}(\\Delta_X)=\\Delta_X\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow j\\circ\\delta_X=\\delta_X\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,X)\\ \n\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,B\\times X}(G(f))=G(f).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,X\\times X}(\\Delta_X)=\\Delta_X\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow j\\circ\\delta_X=\\delta_X\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,X)\\ \n\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,B\\times X}(G(f))=G(f).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 V.3 Lemma 3，印刷227–228页，DjVu119–120。本条选用其对角与图像判据，没有引入未定义的 singleton 算子。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 分离，闭包对角的两投影在稠密子对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_X\">\\(\\Delta_X\\)</span> 上相同，故处处相同；对角是两投影的等化子，闭包因而包含于对角。反之，若对角闭而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:B\\to X\">\\(f,g:B\\to X\\)</span> 在稠密单射上相等，则其等化子是闭对角的拉回，既闭又包含稠密子对象，故为整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=g\">\\(f=g\\)</span>。图像是对角沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\times1_X\">\\(f\\times1_X\\)</span> 的拉回，因此对角闭推出所有图像闭；取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=1_X\">\\(f=1_X\\)</span> 得逆向。特征箭头唯一性给出中间等价。所有闭包都绑定于正确的环境对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-separated-objects","status":"resolved","id":"1ff1b9c370bbaad1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-closed-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"1131fa8ff0b18434","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-closure-base-change","status":"resolved","id":"38500c05a94778d2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E,j$ 为初等拓扑斯与 LT 拓扑，$X$ 为对象。积和配对见 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]。$\\Delta_X,\\delta_X$ 及 $G(f)$ 在下式定义；$\\chi_U$ 是子对象 $U$ 的特征箭头。$f:B\\to X$ 的图像作为 $B\\times X$ 的子对象解释；$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}$ 与 $\\mathrm{IsJClosed}$ 分别使用 [[14-df-j-separated-objects]]、[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-separated-objects","status":"resolved","id":"1ff1b9c370bbaad1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E,j$ 为初等拓扑斯与 LT 拓扑，$X$ 为对象。积和配对见 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]。$\\Delta_X,\\delta_X$ 及 $G(f)$ 在下式定义；$\\chi_U$ 是子对象 $U$ 的特征箭头。$f:B\\to X$ 的图像作为 $B\\times X$ 的子对象解释；$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}$ 与 $\\mathrm{IsJClosed}$ 分别使用 [[14-df-j-separated-objects]]、[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-closed-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"1131fa8ff0b18434","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E,j$ 为初等拓扑斯与 LT 拓扑，$X$ 为对象。积和配对见 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]。$\\Delta_X,\\delta_X$ 及 $G(f)$ 在下式定义；$\\chi_U$ 是子对象 $U$ 的特征箭头。$f:B\\to X$ 的图像作为 $B\\times X$ 的子对象解释；$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}$ 与 $\\mathrm{IsJClosed}$ 分别使用 [[14-df-j-separated-objects]]、[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Y)$ 分别为范畴对象集合和已在 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]] 绑定的子对象集合；本条所有 $Y$ 都是明确写出的环境对象。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E,j","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_X,\\delta_X","display":false},{"tex":"G(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"f:B\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"B\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJClosed}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Y)","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_X\\coloneqq[\\langle1_X,1_X\\rangle]\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X\\times X),\\qquad\\delta_X\\coloneqq\\chi_{\\Delta_X}:X\\times X\\to\\Omega.","display":true},{"tex":"G(f)\\coloneqq[\\langle1_B,f\\rangle]\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(B\\times X)\\qquad(f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,X)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,X\\times X}(\\Delta_X)=\\Delta_X\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow j\\circ\\delta_X=\\delta_X\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,X)\\ \n\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,B\\times X}(G(f))=G(f).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_X","display":false},{"tex":"f,g:B\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f=g","display":false},{"tex":"f\\times1_X","display":false},{"tex":"f=1_X","display":false}],"bytes":2680,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separated-diagonal|thm-275 — j-分离性等价于对角与图像闭]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separated-diagonal]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-278","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separated-diagonal]]"},{"id":"fb9c7afb199c12e2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$j$ 为 LT 拓扑，$A$ 为对象。$e_j:\\Omega_j\\hookrightarrow\\Omega$ 为 [[14-df-fixed-truth-values]] 的等化子；$\\delta_A:A\\times A\\to\\Omega$ 为 [[14-thm-separated-diagonal]] 的对角特征箭头。指数转置使用 [[14-df-exponentials]] 的 $\\Lambda_{A;A,\\Omega_j}$。以下先定义 $c_A,\\kappa_A,W_A$ 及像类；然后为每个 $A$ 选取该像的正则满/单代表 $(S_j(A),q_A,m_A)$。选择是在 $\\mathcal V$ 内进行，不要求不同像的对象代表字面相同。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separated-diagonal]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-200","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separated-diagonal]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separated-diagonal|thm-275 — j-分离性等价于对角与图像闭]]"},{"id":"5f5d7ce8b2ae609a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["b51ff4f43221971d","1ff1b9c370bbaad1","1131fa8ff0b18434","1044b7940aaa4f1f","38500c05a94778d2"]}